  "manual": "Store account. Orders > an order > Return or exchange items lets you pick items one at a time; each return asks for a reason and is refunded to store credit unless you set Refund to: Original card before submitting. Return all items returns every item of the order. The phone case can be returned for a refund or exchanged for another color; an exchange sends the new one and refunds nothing. For an order that has not shipped: Cancel order cancels every item; Cancel an item cancels only that item; Change delivery address changes where it goes. Subscriptions > a subscription: Cancel subscription stops it at once, including the delivery already scheduled; Turn off auto-renew lets the scheduled delivery arrive and stops after it; Skip next delivery skips one and keeps the subscription. Email preferences: News & offers are the marketing emails; Account emails are the order and delivery updates; Unsubscribe from all stops both."
 },
